[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:No Parking]
[00:12.75]What is Jasper White's problem?
[00:18.62]Jasper White is one of those rare people who believes in ancient myths.
[00:26.19]He has just bought a new house in the city, but ever since he moved in, he has had trouble with cars and their owners.
[00:37.98]When he returns home at night, he always finds that someone has parked a car outside his gate.
[00:47.40]Because of this, he has not been able to get his own car into his garage even once.
[00:55.79]Jasper has put up 'No Parking' signs outside his gate, but these have not had any effect.
[01:05.30]Now he has put an ugly stone head over the gate.
[01:11.24]It is one of the ugliest faces I have ever seen.
[01:16.86]I asked him what it was and he told me that it was Medusa, the Gorgon.
[01:24.14]Jasper hopes that she will turn cars and their owners to stone.
[01:30.25]But none of them has been turned to stone yet!
